{"2332730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DAO", "steam_appid": 2332730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I. World Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this small mountain kingdom, Daoer are the most respected peoples. They slay ghosts and safeguard local peace. In 1983, the king was bewitched by a mysterious person and launched a campaign to eradicate daoer. Nearly all daoer across the land were slain. The protagonist survived only because he was away from home. Having lost everything, he vows to avenge and embarks on a perilous journey. <br>Wield weapons and talismans to survive this dark world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >II. Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a semi-open world platform combat game with dozens of enemies and traps. Combine various talismans and weapons, and leverage their unique traits to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras/f471402a61e71f2715ce7fff243fc5fd.avif?t=1779860912\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras_big/f471402a61e71f2715ce7fff243fc5fd.avif?t=1779860912 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras/9181de1dd4177b48828c937c665433de.avif?t=1779860912\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras_big/9181de1dd4177b48828c937c665433de.avif?t=1779860912 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras/50f1a955d7afc51c1585f813921d1145.avif?t=1779860912\" data-big-src=