d1145.avif?t=1779860912\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/extras_big/50f1a955d7afc51c1585f813921d1145.avif?t=1779860912 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DAO is a platform action adventure game. You travel back to a dark era. As the last Daoer of your sect, you set off on a journey of vengeance. Combine diverse weapons and talismans to fight numerous foes, and piece together the kingdom's lost memories from fragments.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/c04ca88b35df8c777d8ae4e5fe76415d5760769e/header.jpg?t=1779860912", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/cd64658d7265879763918c9090c4caea4bc52036/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779860912", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332730/cd64658d7265879763918c9090c4caea4bc52036/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779860912", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 13400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 13400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["XiaoDou